{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">處境劇《愛·回家之開心速遞》帶給觀眾無數歡樂，劇中演員感情更加係好到不得了！飾演「素素」的古佩玲（Kelly）近日迎來生日，適逢中秋佳節，一向人緣極佳的她獲一班「熊家人」齊齊開P慶祝。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"kellyyygu__1790342643_3994005572438971469_333444182.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026sq8h0N3zah1790569302.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"kellyyygu__1790342643_3994005572438971469_333444182.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">古佩玲在社交平台大晒多張慶生靚相，相中見到「根叔」劉丹與太太、「善姐」滕麗名、「水水」呂慧儀與兒子「蟹籽」，仲有「豹哥」單立文與「風少」陳浚霆齊齊撐場。他們準備了兩個精緻的生日蛋糕以及傳統壽桃為她賀壽，大合照時眾人笑容滿面。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"kellyyygu__1790342643_3994005618592882509_333444182.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026yotXXNryh81790569301.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"kellyyygu__1790342643_3994005618592882509_333444182.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">難得成班人齊齊整整聚會，壽星女當然瘋狂打卡！她一時與靚靚「水水」呂慧儀齊齊對鏡頭嘟嘴賣萌，盡顯好姊妹情；一時又與劇中好拍檔「風少」陳浚霆頭貼頭親密合照，畫面Sweet到漏。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">面對劇組滿滿的愛，度過快樂時光的她感動發文：「這個生日過的太溫暖❤️整個 Birthday Month 每一天都過的很開心，很有感觸：生命裡總是會遇到一些人，帶來滿滿暖意，不管過了多久，依舊暖暖的，Family！！！親如家人。」</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"kellyyygu__1790342643_3994005618592882509_333444182.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026yotXXNryh81790569301.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"kellyyygu__1790342643_3994005618592882509_333444182.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"kellyyygu__1790342643_3994005621528975595_333444182.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026CGRodklvlZ1790569302.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"kellyyygu__1790342643_3994005621528975595_333444182.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T04:58:08.227777+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":407,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}